@bad_image_quality: $image_filter
You need to check if image has issues with the proper showing of fingers.
Check if hands have correct number of fingers.
If you don't see any hands, return 'no'.
If you see hands and don't aee any issues, return 'no'.
If you see some issues, return 'yes'.
Return only one word:
'yes' if you see hands and issues with any of them
'no' in all other cases


